---
/**
 * Affiliate Disclosure Page for BudgetTechIndia
 * Clear disclosure about affiliate relationships and earnings
 */

import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import type { BreadcrumbItem } from '../utils/interfaces';

const breadcrumbs: BreadcrumbItem[] = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Affiliate Disclosure' },
];

const lastUpdated = new Date('2026-02-15');
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="BudgetTechIndia participates in affiliate programs including Amazon Associates. Learn how we earn money and maintain editorial integrity."
  lastUpdated={lastUpdated}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  currentPath="/affiliate-disclosure"
>
  <div class="bg-accent-50 border-l-4 border-accent-500 p-6 mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Important Disclosure</h3>
    <p class="text-neutral-700">
      <strong>BudgetTechIndia is a participant in the Amazon Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.in.</strong>
    </p>
    <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm mt-2">
      As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This means we may receive a commission when you click our links and make a purchase, at no additional cost to you.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="what-are-affiliate-links">What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
  <p>
    Affiliate links are special URLs that contain a tracking code unique to our website. When you click on an affiliate link on BudgetTechIndia and make a purchase, the merchant (such as Amazon) can track that the sale came from our website and pay us a small commission.
  </p>
  <p>
    These commissions help support our website and allow us to continue providing free, high-quality content to our readers.
  </p>

  <h2 id="how-we-earn-money">How We Earn Money</h2>
  <p>
    BudgetTechIndia earns revenue through the following methods:
  </p>

  <h3>Amazon Associates Program</h3>
  <p>
    We are a participant in the Amazon Associates Program. When you click on product links that lead to Amazon.in and make a purchase, we earn a commission. The commission rate varies by product category, typically ranging from 0.5% to 10% of the sale price.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Important:</strong> Using our affiliate links does not increase the price you pay. You pay the same price as you would by going directly to Amazon.
  </p>

  <h3>Other Affiliate Programs</h3>
  <p>
    We may also participate in other affiliate programs with various merchants. These relationships are always disclosed in our content.
  </p>

  <h2 id="product-recommendations">Our Product Recommendation Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We take our product recommendations seriously. Here's how we maintain editorial integrity:
  </p>

  <h3>Editorial Independence</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Honest Reviews:</strong> Our reviews are based on actual testing and research. We do not give positive reviews just because a product has a higher commission rate.</li>
    <li><strong>Unbiased Rankings:</strong> Products are ranked based on their merits, not affiliate earnings potential.</li>
    <li><strong>Full Disclosure:</strong> We clearly mention both pros and cons of every product we review.</li>
    <li><strong>No Paid Placements:</strong> We do not accept payment to feature products in our articles.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How We Choose Products</h3>
  <p>
    When selecting products to recommend, we consider:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Value for money</li>
    <li>Build quality and durability</li>
    <li>User reviews and ratings</li>
    <li>Brand reputation and after-sales service</li>
    <li>Features and specifications</li>
    <li>Price point and budget considerations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="price-accuracy">Price Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    Product prices and availability are subject to change without notice. While we strive to keep our information up to date, we cannot guarantee that:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Prices shown on our website are current</li>
    <li>Products will be available at the listed price</li>
    <li>Discounts or offers mentioned are still valid</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Always check the final price on the merchant's website before making a purchase.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2 id="affiliate-link-identification">How to Identify Affiliate Links</h2>
  <p>
    On BudgetTechIndia, affiliate links typically appear as:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Buttons labeled "Check Price on Amazon" or "Buy Now"</li>
    <li>Product images that link to Amazon</li>
    <li>Text links within articles that direct to product pages</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    All affiliate links on our site open in a new tab and include the <code>rel="nofollow sponsored"</code> attribute, which is standard practice for affiliate links.
  </p>

  <h2 id="why-we-use-affiliate-links">Why We Use Affiliate Links</h2>
  <p>
    Running a website like BudgetTechIndia requires significant time and resources:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Content Creation:</strong> Researching, testing, and writing detailed reviews takes hours of work</li>
    <li><strong>Website Maintenance:</strong> Hosting, security, and technical maintenance costs</li>
    <li><strong>Keeping Content Free:</strong> Affiliate revenue allows us to keep all content free for readers</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    By using our affiliate links, you support our work at no extra cost to you. We genuinely appreciate your support!
  </p>

  <h2 id="your-support-matters">Your Support Matters</h2>
  <p>
    When you purchase through our affiliate links, you're helping us:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Continue creating helpful content</li>
    <li>Maintain and improve our website</li>
    <li>Keep all our guides and reviews free</li>
    <li>Invest in better testing equipment and methodologies</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Thank you for supporting BudgetTechIndia!
  </p>

  <h2 id="transparency-commitment">Our Transparency Commitment</h2>
  <p>
    We are committed to being transparent about our affiliate relationships:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>We clearly label affiliate links in our content</li>
    <li>We disclose our affiliate relationships at the beginning of articles</li>
    <li>We never hide or disguise affiliate links</li>
    <li>We regularly review and update this disclosure</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="questions">Questions About Our Affiliate Relationships</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or how we earn money, please don't hesitate to contact us:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@budgettechindia.com">contact@budgettechindia.com</a></li>
    <li><strong>Contact Form:</strong> <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="legal-requirements">Legal Requirements</h2>
  <p>
    We comply with all applicable laws and regulations regarding affiliate disclosures, including:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>FTC Guidelines (for US visitors)</li>
    <li>Advertising Standards Council of India (ASCI) guidelines</li>
    <li>Amazon Associates Program Operating Agreement</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="bg-neutral-100 rounded-lg p-6 mt-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Summary</h3>
    <ul class="text-sm text-neutral-700 space-y-2">
      <li>✓ We use affiliate links to earn commissions</li>
      <li>✓ This doesn't affect the price you pay</li>
      <li>✓ Our recommendations are honest and unbiased</li>
      <li>✓ We clearly disclose affiliate relationships</li>
      <li>✓ Your support helps us create free content</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>